  "summary": "A steam jet vacuum ejector has no moving parts. High-pressure motive steam expands through a converging–diverging nozzle to very high (supersonic) velocity and low pressure, which entrains gas from the suction chamber. In the diffuser the mixture slows down and its pressure rises to the discharge pressure. Several ejectors in series with condensers reach deep vacuum.",
